@startuml
[*] --> Planned : Shipment Created
Planned --> ReadyForDispatch : Inventory Picked & Packed
ReadyForDispatch --> Dispatched : Carrier Scanned Package
Dispatched --> InTransit : Left Warehouse Dock
InTransit --> Delayed : Weather or Route Exception
Delayed --> InTransit : Exception Cleared
InTransit --> OutForDelivery : At Final Delivery Hub
OutForDelivery --> Delivered : Customer Signed
OutForDelivery --> FailedAttempt : Customer Not Available
FailedAttempt --> OutForDelivery : Redelivery Scheduled
FailedAttempt --> ReturnedToSender : Max Attempts Reached
Delivered --> [*]
ReturnedToSender --> [*]
@enduml
